Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.25,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天唱K真是嗨爆了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刘海要怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.76,0:00:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听说高三吉田学姐的男朋友特别帅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.68,0:00:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的 好羡慕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫濑尾拓也 目前高一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,说白了就是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:40.45,0:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但并不是普通的动画宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,实不相瞒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个爱看女童向动画的阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,应募者限定的闪萌橡皮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,总算拿到手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（闪亮萌宠）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:57.18,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是周日早上十点播出的女童向动画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,全称闪亮萌宠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然角色和世界观很可爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但剧情却格外黑暗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.56,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以被戏称为深夜三十四点的动画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.27,0:01:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,异常沉重的设定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有随处穿插的谜一般的奇葩搞笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.69,0:01:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,牢牢抓住了一部分粉丝的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:17.28,0:01:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然上一季动画爆火
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-但这一季没什么人关注\n-糟了 忘带橡皮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-可我觉得它是整个系列最好看的一季\n-找阿宅同学借吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.75,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,橡皮借我用用哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我会还给你的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这有点不好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 为什么啊 就用一下而已嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它对我来说很重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很重要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是怪萌对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.65,0:01:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,闪亮萌宠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 也差不多啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.41,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听说过呢 很有名吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.83,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她是坐在我前面的伊地知琴子同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,性格大大咧咧 是个典型的辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.04,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我应付不来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,经常和她在一起的是天音庆同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是个像模特一样的冷酷辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我应付不来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.59,0:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.68,0:02:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 你看这个 波卡丘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 这是凯比
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,它是主角的搭档
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.81,0:02:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在第4集首次登场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是个用绿宝石战斗的闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你在说什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.65,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.03,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,明明首次登场是在第2集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.99,0:02:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 刚才那句话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.54,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也是闪萌吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.71,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.21,0:02:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是名叫兹凯奇的闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只要按一下屁股 眼珠就会弹出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,笑死我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.42,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有点感兴趣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌讲的是什么样的故事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是阿宅最想被问到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.31,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是问自己喜欢的角色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至还问剧情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.61,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对于憋了一肚子话想说的阿宅来说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.73,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个提议简直就是天赐良机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天真无邪的神助攻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学太可怕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.66,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一个阿宅不停说着别人不感兴趣的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么想都太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:31.41,0:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,想说却不能说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 你怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.59,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是说了什么奇怪的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我交到好朋友了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.43,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直接给你看更快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天带漫画过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.23,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 天音 你很熟悉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多可爱的角色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你说不定也会喜欢上的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.73,0:04:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.94,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也会？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.61,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在说我妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她特别喜欢这部作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真的诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,凯比确实在第2集就出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.68,0:04:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.51,0:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,连我都没注意到凯比首次登场的画面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.85,0:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不感兴趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是肯定不可能知道的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但这可是冷门的女童向动画啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,实在难以置信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在班上人气顶尖的天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会喜欢这种
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.25,0:04:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,放学去唱K不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 今天就不去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.67,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想合唱一首歌来着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.14,0:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-好想跟她聊聊\n-下次吧 我先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可让我这个阿宅去跟辣妹搭话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.77,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就算这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能是第一个能聊闪萌的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.28,0:05:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.53,0:05:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.49,0:05:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.99,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,离得好近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我妹妹喜欢闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我妹妹经常看而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是我喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.80,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.26,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 是我擅自误会了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该对这种东西不感兴趣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,比如限定钥匙扣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.89,0:05:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是漫画第一卷的初回特典异色款啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真羡慕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.32,0:06:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我跑了三家店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,买到的全都是普通颜色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.53,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我妹妹 她一直在家里抱怨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要拿出来看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不得了 太可爱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.37,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,话说做成粉色的简直就是天才吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,原版是黑色的 有种反差萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意的话就拿去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我有两个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.85,0:06:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我妹妹会很高兴的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.23,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太可爱啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹！？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.73,0:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大家精神还好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.95,0:07:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也要精神饱满地度过哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊 伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.55,0:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,棒球社的 晨练辛苦啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.13,0:07:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真由 早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.68,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 伊地知 早啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.48,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知飞碟把阿宅同学的橡皮吸走啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是忘带了就直说吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,被你发现啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,自从前几天换座位坐到我前面以后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她就一直这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.66,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对我这个阿宅 她也愿意正常接触
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实挺开心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.67,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-可就是距离感有点…\n-咦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个跟之前的不一样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是救援兽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你看了闪萌吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就看了一点点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,天音把漫画借给我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.72,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,漫画改编得真棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,原创动画普遍节奏很奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而漫画里就处理得很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.06,0:08:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,既忠实于原著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又深挖了因篇幅原因而省略的设定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让角色之间的关系更容易理解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一不小心就说个没完
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那样也太恶心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 慢慢说吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我在认真听呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 你有点像火箭侠啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 火箭侠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.59,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你说火箭侠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.05,0:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,指的是主角的朋友 小圆的搭档吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭侠是个很可靠的闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它会主动带着胆小的小圆前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪里像它了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 有圆圆的眼睛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还有动不动就脸红这一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.21,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹！？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（在有乌鸦晒太阳的公园里散步）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.67,0:09:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你玩Mins吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.38,0:09:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 就随便问问
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我有账号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.18,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但发的都是些见不得人的内容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是有嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些全都是闪萌吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,濑尾发的全都是动漫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太阴暗了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没眼看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又要开始被人当恶心死宅欺负了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不得了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 这幅画是你画的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,画得真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得恶心吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里恶心了 很厉害的好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,能这么执着地收集东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这么投入地喜欢一件事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的特别佩服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.80,0:09:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她并没有嫌弃我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.18,0:10:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,全是东西也挺空虚的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.81,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.77,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔发点这样的内容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也不错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.66,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔对待阿宅的辣妹这种人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.51,0:10:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天播的闪萌里 布丁消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,布丁是敌方的闪萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.89,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,平时总爱挖苦人 很讨人厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.98,0:10:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但它理解小幸的本质
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有时还会给出犀利的建议
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.81,0:10:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是个很神奇的角色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（布丁：再见了）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,之前埋的伏笔终于收回了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,它为了保护小幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.70,0:10:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,牺牲了自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,布丁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,到底为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这份悲伤 这份冲动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好想和谁分享
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可闪萌是一部冷门的女童向动画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我身边根本没人看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她的表情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛通红
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.85,0:11:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,叹了好长一声气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.31,0:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不会错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是为布丁流的眼泪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.57,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学今天是不是比平时更有魅力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,谈恋爱了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-也对 想哭的理由太多了\n-感觉她会谈场像电视剧里一样的恋爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是像天音同学这样的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,又出bug卡住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧出补丁修复啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,布丁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 你也玩这款游戏吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.05,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,加个好友呗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.35,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要个道具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你是在说这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚才果然是在为布丁流泪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.77,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定是个阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.36,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.03,0:12:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.90,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,和我交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了 看得我都心跳加速了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,男子篮球社的队长向你表白了对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你还拒绝他了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我跟他不熟啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.09,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的好受欢迎啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.72,0:12:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第几个了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.72,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-天音同学那么光鲜亮丽 又受欢迎\n-毕竟你是个大美女呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-应该还是我想多了吧\n-皮肤也很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.02,0:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,经常买护肤品吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊 顶多就买点防晒霜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.94,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.98,0:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱都花在什么地方了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.98,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然是闪萌…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.53,0:13:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,闪亮的小饰品之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚才是不是想说闪萌的周边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有点意外呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.41,0:13:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行 不能什么都往这方面联想\n-诶 小饰品啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你书包上的挂饰也很可爱呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,挂饰 是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.96,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个挂饰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是小幸的魔法杖胸针
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说是饰品店出的闪萌联动限定款
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但完全就是女童向的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.73,0:13:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思买啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好羡慕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.52,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,连这么稀有的东西都买
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.61,0:13:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定没错了 天音同学果然…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.15,0:13:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才在看我包上的挂饰吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我自己想买的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.95,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是妹妹缠着我非要买 我才买了一对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我绝对不是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天布丁牺牲了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我哭了一整晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.63,0:14:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同学 你讨厌闪萌吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 那还用说吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当然喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.60,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是我妹妹喜欢\n我就跟着一起看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你不要误会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.15,0:14:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是在交往吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.36,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.57,0:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你从哪个部分开始听的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.90,0:14:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,又是喜欢 又是叫他不要误会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊 呃…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在说挂饰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.24,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 阿宅…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 没带
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.13,0:14:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没带
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘带课本了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,翻到56页
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.06,0:15:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,偏偏这门课是全校最凶的老师教
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（英语老师（36岁） 游泳部顾问 外号黑手党）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-课桌上空空如也可不行\n-今天接着讲昨天学的过去完成时
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.90,0:15:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-总之\n-这也是期中考试的重点内容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-把数学书放着装样子\n-这部分很重要 所以要重点讲解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-就这样\n-课本上的例句
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.11,0:15:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,混过去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从小林开始 按学号顺序轮流读
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 学号？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小林 斋藤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,白川 须藤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学 红笔借我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.69,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被她发现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.69,0:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快看 阿宅同学用数学书装样子\n搞笑吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.33,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被揭穿\n就算伊地知同学没有恶意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会被全班同学笑话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 我忘带课本了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 伊地知 你又忘带了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 找人借着一起看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我旁边有空位哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我让濑尾同学借给我看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.84,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.85,0:16:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,用数学书装样子也太搞笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到你读的时候你打算怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:22.77,0:16:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,课本
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她在帮我打掩护
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.23,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时总借我东西用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是回礼啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那红笔借我咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,濑尾 伊地知 看前面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.00,0:16:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪里有温柔对待阿宅的辣妹！？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅与辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去社团吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.80,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.05,0:16:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,今天去唱K吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.18,0:16:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你昨天不是才刚去过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-天音 你呢\n-只要开心 天天去都行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天天都去还是会腻的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.10,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那两个人真的好可爱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.64,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,听说天音同学以前当过模特
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,琴子长得也像偶像一样 真可爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.03,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知很好相处呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.99,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想被天音同学骂一顿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是理所当然的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但我重新认识到 我这个阴暗的阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.00,0:17:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,和她们根本活在不同的世界里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.51,0:17:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,今天发售的闪亮萌宠手办盲盒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,每人限购一个的稀有款
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何都要买到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.57,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.03,0:17:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-市政厅在哪边\n-诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,市政厅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不知道在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,手机呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:06.54,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,手机啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,花了不少时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过总算来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.85,0:18:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉没什么人气 心情有点复杂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好激动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我要买咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.11,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹特别期待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.37,0:18:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我来帮她买
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是阿宅同学嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.33,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种地方碰到 不愧是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.75,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,闪萌手办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.00,0:18:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.25,0:18:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,话说你们俩今天不是要去唱K吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,男生太多 搞得像联谊\n所以就不去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.68,0:19:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看到天音兴冲冲地出门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉跟着她一起过来更好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.15,0:19:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,果然天音同学是来买闪萌的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好想跟她说 我们一起买吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（闪亮萌宠手办盲盒）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.12,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一起买的话\n抽中心仪款的概率会更高
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.83,0:19:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-而且 肯定会很开心\n-不过天音这么开心的样子还真少见呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.58,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没有那么开心呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.33,0:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 小隆同学刚才哭了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.75,0:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说天音不来了好难过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.26,0:19:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他太缠人了 我应付不来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.68,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本就不是一个世界的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅和辣妹是合不来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等下再偷偷回来买吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.28,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要买手办对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一起买嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会买了帮天音的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.41,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要是抽到大帝万普 可以跟我换吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.17,0:20:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.79,0:20:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-是我妹妹最喜欢的角色\n-来吧 快挑一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.54,0:20:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.39,0:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抽到了 是我想要的露娜小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.85,0:20:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.85,0:20:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（葵叶市政厅）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是刚才帮助他人的回报吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:47.28,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来 看看我能抽到什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.12,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同学 这是隐藏款啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,万普大人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:02.01,0:21:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我没抽到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.76,0:21:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过布丁我也很喜欢呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔对待阿宅的辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定真的有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.65,0:21:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第1节 阿宅 辣妹与闪萌）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.83,0:22:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会变成这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.79,0:22:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:58.04,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到收拾得还挺干净的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:00.29,0:23:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所以画在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.63,0:23:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的两个辣妹居然来我的房间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:05.63,0:23:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
